# Ogre 14 install — built per-platform from ext/ogre-source/ on every
# developer machine and CI runner. Layout differs between Linux (.so files
# under lib/) and macOS (frameworks under lib/macosx/Release/), so a single
# tracked copy would poison cross-platform builds via find_package(OGRE).
ext/ogre/install/
.vscode
*.vim
*.vim
*.pyc
.history
frame*

# CMake-generated artifacts that occasionally land at the repo root
# when cmake is invoked from the source tree by mistake. They belong
# in build/ only.
/CPackConfig.cmake
/CPackSourceConfig.cmake
/cmake_uninstall.cmake
/ogre.cfg
/plugins.cfg
/resources.cfg
